    "scenesThatPass": [
      "INQUISITOR: Bring her in now, please.\nINQUISITOR: Lt. Ballard, please be seated.\nMELANIE: Do I get a lawyer or don't police officers have rights these days?\nINQUISITOR: Representation by counsel won't be necessary. Your rights are protected by the Matronage. You can speak freely.",
      "BASHIRA: I hate this thing!\nHELENA: You'll get used to it. Two years ago we still wore full-face breathers.\nMELANIE: Takes about a month to get over the headaches out here.\nBASHIRA: This is Shining Canyon? -- What a dump!",
      "BASHIRA: (slightly hysterical} Nothing. I can't even reach the train.\nMELANIE: : What do you think?",
      "AKOOSHAY: What' s going on around here? We haven't had a meso, or a piss break in six hours!\nHELENA: Everybody quiet down! We'll get your needs taken care of, but first we're trying to locate the Duty Officer.",
      "HELENA: All right, knock it off! Who's that? I don't have anyone else on the log.\nAKOOSHAY: She showed up last night and checked herself in. Insisted on being locked up with us."
    ]
  },
